Here's a basic Nginx config for your Node app:

```
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name yourdomain.com;
    location / {
        proxy_pass http://localhost:3000;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Upgrade $http_upgrade;
        proxy_set_header Connection 'upgrade';
    }
}
```

Drop this in /etc/nginx/sites-available, symlink to sites-enabled, then run `sudo nginx -t` and `sudo systemctl reload nginx`. Test it out and let me know if you hit any snags!
